--- !u!114 &1640353150
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1640353149}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: af58fd65b6101b84db625472a7c6c834, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OpeningCutsceneTextSkip
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to the world of Spritz.
  - Deeper into this planet, there reside five major continents.
  - Pixelville.
  - Greenwood.
  - Ninja Valley.
  - Frosty Outpost.
  - and Wizardspeak.
  - These five places, each home to communities of Sprites, once lived in harmony.
  - But decades ago...
  - War broke out.
  - A war that shattered alliances... and split the continent apart.
  - A peace agreement ended the fighting.
  - With one rule written above all others.
  - Never step into another's territory.
  - In the ruins of Wizarspeak... there lived a man known only as the Wiz.
  - Founder of a city built on magic. Education. Hope.
  - Or at least... that's what it used to be.
  - Now, all that remained were ashes and debris of crumbled buildings.
  - And no one cared.
  - Day after day, The Wiz planned his revenge.
  - But piece by piece.
  - Using forbidden engineering magic...
  - He built a slime generator.
  - And chose Greenwood... as the place to begin.
  - from that moment on... the world of Spritz would never be the same.
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  autoStart: 1
